/E (Our alumni have made remarkable strides in the mobility and automotive sectors, applying the technical expertise and leadership skills they developed during their time with Ashwa. One such example is Abhishek Chandrashekar, a 2015 graduate, who played a key role in the Chassis and Workshop Management subsystem. He went on to co-found Royal Brothers, a successful bike rental startup that has transformed urban mobility in South India. His journey reflects the entrepreneurial mindset and problem-solving abilities that Ashwa Mobility instills in its members.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
