337 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Excitement filled the air as the team arrived at the venue and set up the pit. The team began with unloading the car and preparing the workspace. By 11:00 AM, registration was completed, and they dove straight into the crucial task of fine-tuning the prototype - XX5-C. The main focus was to resolve key mechanical aspects, including suspension adjustments and drivetrain assembly. However, during these checks, they identified a significant gap at the front-left rocker clamp, an issue that needed immediate attention. As time passed, preparations continued into the evening.)
/E (Excitement filled the air as the team arrived at the venue and set up the pit. The team began with unloading the car and preparing the workspace. By 11:00 AM, registration was completed, and they dove straight into the crucial task of fine-tuning the prototype - XX5-C. The main focus was to resolve key mechanical aspects, including suspension adjustments and drivetrain assembly. However, during these checks, they identified a significant gap at the front-left rocker clamp, an issue that needed immediate attention. As time passed, preparations continued into the evening.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [2]
>>
