349 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (The day began with a panoramic photoshoot before they rushed to a welder to address a hole in the chassis. After clearing the pre-technical inspection, new challenges emerged. Car's ground clearance issues, the bodywork and side-pods scraping the track, demanded a swift redesign of the pull rods. While addressing a rear brake line leak, the bleed screw sheared off, forcing to replace the calliper. Despite these setbacks, the team remained determined. In the mechanical technical inspection, the inspectors flagged several concerns, like the front-right wheel wobble, Positive stops for clutch and accelerator pedals, overlap check for the aluminum firewall, and requirement for aluminum tape on the inside of bodyworks.)
/E (The day began with a panoramic photoshoot before they rushed to a welder to address a hole in the chassis. After clearing the pre-technical inspection, new challenges emerged. Car's ground clearance issues, the bodywork and side-pods scraping the track, demanded a swift redesign of the pull rods. While addressing a rear brake line leak, the bleed screw sheared off, forcing to replace the calliper. Despite these setbacks, the team remained determined. In the mechanical technical inspection, the inspectors flagged several concerns, like the front-right wheel wobble, Positive stops for clutch and accelerator pedals, overlap check for the aluminum firewall, and requirement for aluminum tape on the inside of bodyworks.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
